when there is change in resources or technology with
respect to both the goods.
Rightward Shift in PPF: When there is "Advancement
or Upgradation of Technology" or/and "Growth of
Resources) in respect to both the goods, then PPF
will shift to the right. For example, if there is
increase in resources for production of butter and
guns, we can produce more of both the goods. In
such case, existing PPF (PP) will shift to the right
