SHIFT IN PPF
Leftward Shift in PPF: PPF will shift towards left,
when there is a technological degradation and/or
decrease in resources with respect to both the
goods. For example, destruction of resources in an
earthquake will reduce the productive capacity and
as a result, PPF will shift to the left.
