PPF shows transformation of one good into another, not
physically, but by diverting resources from one use to the
other.
PPF shows the maximum available possibilities. The exact
point of operation depends on how well the resources of
the economy are used.
If the economy operates on PPF (like points A, B or C), it
means resources are fully & efficiently utilised.
If the economy operates at any point inside PPF (like point
'D'), it means resources are not fully and efficiently utilised.
